     The ppccssccpp driver provides support for the Advanced Micro Devices Am53c974
     PCscsi-PCI SCSI controller and boards using this chip, including the
     Tekram DC-390 PCI SCSI host adapter.

     For Tekram DC-390U/F PCI SCSI host adapters, use the siop(4) driver.

